## Pipeline

Updates from [git push no-mistakes](https://github.com/kunchenguid/no-mistakes)

<!-- no-mistakes-pipeline-attestation:v1 {"head_sha":"4a5b57ca837738e1624928d3fb59a7fcbe6531e7","steps":[{"step":"intent","status":"completed"},{"step":"rebase","status":"completed"},{"step":"review","status":"completed"},{"step":"test","status":"completed"},{"step":"document","status":"completed"},{"step":"lint","status":"completed"},{"step":"push","status":"completed"},{"step":"pr","status":"running"},{"step":"ci","status":"pending"}]} -->

